Ai2 da2 dy2 LS04_INV
Ai3 da3 dy3 LS04_INV
Ai4 da4 dy4 LS04_INV
Ai5 da5 dy5 LS04_INV
Ai6 da6 dy6 LS04_INV
Adac [dy1 dy2 dy3 dy4 dy5 dy6] [l1 l2 l3 l4 l5 l6] LS_DAC
X2 l1 2 14 7 LS_OUT
X4 l2 4 14 7 LS_OUT
X6 l3 6 14 7 LS_OUT
X8 l4 8 14 7 LS_OUT
X10 l5 10 14 7 LS_OUT
X12 l6 12 14 7 LS_OUT
