Apwr [vs] [pwr] LS_PWR
* 异步控制：CLR 高有效优先于 /LOAD 低有效
Anclr clr nclr LS_INV0
Anld nld ld_raw LS_INV0
Ald [nclr ld_raw] ld_en LS_AND0
