Asb [ld_en b] setb LS_AND0
Arlb [ld_en nb] rlb LS_AND0
Arb [clr rlb] rstb LS_OR0
Asc [ld_en c] setc LS_AND0
Arlc [ld_en nc] rlc LS_AND0
Arc [clr rlc] rstc LS_OR0
Asd [ld_en d] setd LS_AND0
Arld [ld_en nd] rld LS_AND0
Ard [clr rld] rstd LS_OR0
* 双时钟沿合成与方向锁存（UP 下降沿锁存 dir_up=1，DN 下降沿锁存 dir_up=0，免疫任意慢上升沿过渡区）
Anp pwr npwr LS_INV0
Azero [pwr npwr] zero LS_AND0
Vdir_por dir_por 0 PULSE(0 5 1n 1n 1n 1e6 2e6)
Rdir_por dir_por 0 100k
Adir_por [dir_por] [dp] LS_ADC
Anup up nup LS_INV0
Andn dn ndn LS_INV0
Adclk0 [nup ndn] dclk_raw LS_OR0
Adclk [dclk_raw dp] dir_clk LS_AND0
Affdir dn dir_clk zero zero dir_up dir_dn LS_DFF
Ack [up dn pwr] ick LS_AND0
* BCD 加一组合逻辑（0->1->...->9->0）
Aib_x [qb qa] ib_x LS_XOR0
Aib [nqd ib_x] inc_b LS_AND0
Aqba [qb qa] qba LS_AND0
Aic_x [qc qba] ic_x LS_XOR0
Aic [nqd ic_x] inc_c LS_AND0
Aid1 [qd nqa] id1 LS_AND0
Aid2 [qc qb qa] id2 LS_AND0
Aid [id1 id2] inc_d LS_OR0
* BCD 减一组合逻辑（9->8->...->0->9）
Ais0 [nqd nqc nqb nqa] is0 LS_AND0
Anis0 is0 nis0 LS_INV0
Adb_x [qb nqa] db_x LS_XOR0
Adb [nis0 db_x] dec_b LS_AND0
Anqba [nqb nqa] nqba LS_AND0
Adc_x [qc nqba] dc_x LS_XOR0
Adc [nis0 dc_x] dec_c LS_AND0
Add1 [qd qa] dd1 LS_AND0
Add [is0 dd1] dec_d LS_OR0
* 方向选择下一态（QA 无论加减均翻转）
Anb1 [dir_up inc_b] nb1 LS_AND0
Anb2 [dir_dn dec_b] nb2 LS_AND0
Anb_in [nb1 nb2] next_b LS_OR0
Anc1 [dir_up inc_c] nc1 LS_AND0
Anc2 [dir_dn dec_c] nc2 LS_AND0
Anc_in [nc1 nc2] next_c LS_OR0
And1 [dir_up inc_d] nd1 LS_AND0
And2 [dir_dn dec_d] nd2 LS_AND0
And_in [nd1 nd2] next_d LS_OR0
Affa nqa ick seta rsta qa nqa LS_DFF
Affb next_b ick setb rstb qb nqb LS_DFF
Affc next_c ick setc rstc qc nqc LS_DFF
Affd next_d ick setd rstd qd nqd LS_DFF
* 进位 /CO = ~(Q==9 & UP==0)，借位 /BO = ~(Q==0 & DOWN==0)
Ais9 [qd nqc nqb qa] is9 LS_AND0
Aco [is9 nup] nco LS_NAND0
Abo [is0 ndn] nbo LS_NAND0
Adac [qa qb qc qd nco nbo] [la lb lc ld lco lbo] LS_DAC
X3 la 3 16 8 LS_OUT
X2 lb 2 16 8 LS_OUT
X6 lc 6 16 8 LS_OUT
X7 ld 7 16 8 LS_OUT
X12 lco 12 16 8 LS_OUT
X13 lbo 13 16 8 LS_OUT
.ends SN74LS192

